  "Quick Stations, Extra Tray, and Cozy Cafe provide permanent saved support for later attempts, with three levels each.": "Quick Stations, Extra Tray e Cozy Cafe forniscono supporto salvato permanente per tentativi successivi, con tre livelli ciascuno.",
